{{also|arborvitae}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{uder|en|la|arbor||tree}} + {{m|la|vitae}}, genitive singular of {{m|la|vita||life}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|arbor vitae|s|arbores vitae}}

# Any of the evergreen trees and shrubs known as [[arborvitae]], of the [[genus|genera]] {{taxfmt|Thuja|genus}} and {{taxfmt|Thujopsis|genus}}, or of the [[species]] {{taxlink|Platycladus orientalis|species}}.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1882|title=Annual Report of the Minnesota State Horticultural Society|page=27
|passage=Next spring the owner of the hedge will be very much surprised to find a number of his '''arbor vitae''' deceased, and he will straightway blame himself and his horse? Not he! The nurseyman, sir, must have delivered him some poor stock!}}
# {{lb|en|anatomy}} White matter of the [[cerebellum]].
#: ''connected to fibres of the arbor vitae and to divaricating axons''

